OL,3,GNEWSABlock for 250 inmates built at HMP
OL,4,AElmley
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new block to hold almost 250 more
OL,7,Fprisoners has been built at HMP Elmley.
OL,9,FThe first of 247 inmates are expected
OL,10,Fto move into the new cells at the
OL,11,FCategory B/C jail, on the Isle of
OL,12,FSheppey, in Kent, in the coming weeks,
OL,13,Faccording to the Ministry of Justice.
OL,15,FIt said the new building was armed with
OL,16,Fsecure windows to keep drones carrying
OL,17,F"contraband" at bay.
OL,19,FA workshop has also been constructed in
OL,20,Fa bid to ensure prisoners leave jail
OL,21,Fwith skills to help them find work upon
OL,22,Frelease.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
